    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PAIN-TO-WIN is a top-down horror-shooter set in a dystopian prison-world that will never happen. You play as an organ extractor, earning money by bounty hunting madmen, psychos, and other violent degenerates. Inspired by PSX-era maniac aesthetics like LOADED and THRILL KILL, mixed with the top-down gore and mayhem of modern Miami-like games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/fb7c97fd075864c30a5a2da531180f19.poster.avif?t=1753085814\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/fb7c97fd075864c30a5a2da531180f19.webm?t=1753085814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/fb7c97fd075864c30a5a2da531180f19.mp4?t=1753085814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Chaotic Mess of Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explosive and brutal gunfights with destructible level environments create chaotic combat, bloodshed, and gore \u2014 each encounter can leave the map twisted and ruined.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Megaprison Freaks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the Megaprison and meet its psycho inmates \u2014 violent brain-surgery addicts, broken minds, and body-mod fanatics. They\u2019ll trade organs, share deranged stories, offer side quests\u2026 or try to kill you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">World of Pain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy perks and upgrades to survive a little longer and crawl deeper inside a world fueled by hate, torture, and crude surgery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deadly Maze of Madness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Handcrafted, highly detailed non-pixel art levels \u2014 packed with dangers, secrets, and mobs of deranged enemies \u2014 connect through a shifting maze with rogue-lite elements, making every run feel a little different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/7ab52dcf020ff1a8e704c3f463413432.poster.avif?t=1753085814\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/7ab52dcf020ff1a8e704c3f463413432.webm?t=1753085814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/7ab52dcf020ff1a8e704c3f463413432.mp4?t=1753085814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PAIN-TO-WIN is a top-down horror-shooter set in a dystopian prison-world that will never happen. You play as an organ extractor, earning money by bounty hunting madmen, psychos, and other violent degenerates. Inspired by PSX-era maniac aesthetics like LOADED and THRILL KILL, mixed with the top-down gore and mayhem of modern Miami-like games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/fb7c97fd075864c30a5a2da531180f19.poster.avif?t=1753085814\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/fb7c97fd075864c30a5a2da531180f19.webm?t=1753085814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/fb7c97fd075864c30a5a2da531180f19.mp4?t=1753085814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Chaotic Mess of Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explosive and brutal gunfights with destructible level environments create chaotic combat, bloodshed, and gore \u2014 each encounter can leave the map twisted and ruined.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Megaprison Freaks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the Megaprison and meet its psycho inmates \u2014 violent brain-surgery addicts, broken minds, and body-mod fanatics. They\u2019ll trade organs, share deranged stories, offer side quests\u2026 or try to kill you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">World of Pain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy perks and upgrades to survive a little longer and crawl deeper inside a world fueled by hate, torture, and crude surgery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deadly Maze of Madness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Handcrafted, highly detailed non-pixel art levels \u2014 packed with dangers, secrets, and mobs of deranged enemies \u2014 connect through a shifting maze with rogue-lite elements, making every run feel a little different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/7ab52dcf020ff1a8e704c3f463413432.poster.avif?t=1753085814\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/7ab52dcf020ff1a8e704c3f463413432.webm?t=1753085814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/7ab52dcf020ff1a8e704c3f463413432.mp4?t=1753085814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
